```
$ gen-circleci-orb config show --help
Print the current configuration

Usage: gen-circleci-orb config show

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```

```
$ gen-circleci-orb config suppress --help
Suppress job generation for a subcommand (generate_job = false)

Usage: gen-circleci-orb config suppress <SUBCOMMAND>

Arguments:
  <SUBCOMMAND>  Subcommand name to suppress

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```

```
$ gen-circleci-orb config unsuppress --help
Re-enable job generation for a previously suppressed subcommand

Usage: gen-circleci-orb config unsuppress <SUBCOMMAND>

Arguments:
  <SUBCOMMAND>  Subcommand name to unsuppress

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```

```
$ gen-circleci-orb config add-job-group --help
Append a composed job group

Usage: gen-circleci-orb config add-job-group [OPTIONS] --name <NAME>

Options:
      --name <NAME>
          Name of the new job group
      --steps <STEPS>
          Comma-separated list of subcommand step names
      --description <DESCRIPTION>
          Optional description for the job group
      --params <PARAMS>
          Comma-separated explicit parameter list (omit for auto-detected
          shared params)
  -h, --help
          Print help

```

```
$ gen-circleci-orb config set-default --help
Set or update a parameter default override for a subcommand

Usage: gen-circleci-orb config set-default --subcommand <SUBCOMMAND> --param <PARAM> --default <DEFAULT>

Options:
      --subcommand <SUBCOMMAND>  Subcommand name
      --param <PARAM>            Parameter name
      --default <DEFAULT>        New default value
  -h, --help                     Print help

```
